      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-10T15:58:35.440Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s often heartening to know even Christopher and Adam can’t always keep all this stuff straight. Mostly because they’re now keeping track of it all so they don’t have to.</p>\n<p>The manic glee with which they approach college and high school puns and references is frankly, at times, terrifying.</p>\n<p>Missed an opportunity to name her Ada Nabet. :V</p>\n<p>Pony Keg is the Critical Role/MLP crossover no one needs.</p>\n<p>Ah, so it’s all Demoncat’s fault. Good to know.</p>\n<p>Writer’s Room: Harpy vs. villains who control various flightless birds and/or dinosaurs.</p>\n<p>Show notes weren’t kidding, this was a mess!</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-05-10T15:58:35.440Z",
