      "name": "Andrew ",
      "username": "Burrower",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/burrower/{size}/5119_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-12T08:47:49.287Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"X-metal\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"29302\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/48/4892_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> X-metal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wait, do we know why Sky- Scraper changes her name in-universe in the RPG timeline?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>While they haven’t said, this episode made me realise that both K.N.Y.F.E. and Sky-Scraper are names that were given by their enemies- Paige got given the codename by FILTER, and Portia was given the title from Kaargra. So it reasonable to assume that they BOTH renamed themselves to get away from their past</p>",
