      "created_at": "2026-01-08T17:25:17.081Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Weird that when they realized punching SuperSenior would drain Legacy, they didn’t think of having her eyebeam SS, before they would think of Unity making keg fists.</p>\n<p>I really like the picture of armored Huginn and Muninn with spinny rings around it.  I would do exactly three rings, which rotate on the tridimensional axes like a gyroscope, metaphysically stabilizing the bird to act as a better familiar for Harpy’s magic.</p>",
